---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Privacy policy — Château de la Huberdière"
  description="How the Château de la Huberdière collects and protects your personal data, in compliance with the GDPR."
  lang="en"
  path="/politique-de-confidentialite"
>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>
      The Château de la Huberdière is committed to protecting your personal data. This policy
      explains what data is collected, why, and what your rights are, in compliance with the
      General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
    </p>

    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      ELLEDIPI (SAS), operator of the Château de la Huberdière, La Huberdière,
      37530 Nazelles-Négron, France.<br />
      Contact: contact@chateaudelahuberdiere.com
    </p>

    <h2>Data collected and purposes</h2>
    <p>
      When you fill in a contact or enquiry form, we collect your first name, last name, email
      address, phone number and the content of your message. This data is used solely to answer
      your request and send you a proposal. The legal basis is your consent and our legitimate
      interest in handling your request.
    </p>
    <p>
      This information is processed via our customer relationship tool (Brevo). It is never sold
      or transferred to third parties for commercial purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention period</h2>
    <p>
      Your data is kept for the time needed to handle your request, then archived or deleted within
      three years of the last contact, unless a legal obligation requires otherwise.
    </p>

    <h2>Audience measurement and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The site uses audience measurement to understand its traffic. Two levels:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        An anonymous, cookieless measurement (Umami), which does not identify you and does not
        require consent.
      </li>
      <li>
        A more detailed measurement via Google Analytics and Google Ads, set only if you accept it
        through the consent banner. You can decline without any impact on your browsing.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Your choice is stored in your browser. You can change it at any time by clearing the site
      data in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict and object to the processing of your
      data, as well as the right to data portability. To exercise these rights, write to
      contact@chateaudelahuberdiere.com. You may also lodge a complaint with the French data
      protection authority, the CNIL (www.cnil.fr).
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any question regarding your data: contact@chateaudelahuberdiere.com</p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 150px 24px 110px;
    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
    color: #2e3a48;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    color: #212121;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #8b0000;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 40px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal p { margin: 0 0 14px; color: #4a4a4a; }
  .legal ul { margin: 0 0 14px; padding-left: 20px; color: #4a4a4a; }
  .legal li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
</style>
